# Playwright run artefacts. Nothing under app/e2e/__screenshots__ is a
# visual-regression baseline (no spec does toHaveScreenshot/toMatchSnapshot) —
# they are eyeballed, and their bytes churn on every run even when nothing
# changed, so they are local-only. See app/e2e/__screenshots__/README.md.
app/e2e/test-results/
app/e2e/test-results-foreman/
# Playwright also drops a run summary at the repo root when it is invoked
# from app/ with a rootDir above it. Same throwaway output, different place.
test-results/
app/e2e/__screenshots__/foreman/
app/e2e/__screenshots__/**/*.png
# ...except the six docs/map-readability-2026-07-29.md embeds by path and
# renders on GitHub, which stay committed on purpose.
!app/e2e/__screenshots__/BLACK22-map-390.png
!app/e2e/__screenshots__/BLACK22-sheet-390.png
!app/e2e/__screenshots__/PECAN14-map-390.png
!app/e2e/__screenshots__/PECAN14-sheet-390.png
!app/e2e/__screenshots__/OAKRIDGE-map-390.png
!app/e2e/__screenshots__/OAKRIDGE-sheet-390.png
app/playwright-report/
app/blob-report/
app/.playwright/

# The test login's password (docs/test-account.md). Local only, never committed.
.secrets/
